 Object.assign(convert.T, typeof convertContext !== "undefined" ? convertContext : {}); return convert.T.applyChange('.reviews-container', {"originalSelector":".reviews-container","outerHtml":"<div class=\"reviews-container\"><hr class=\"rating-divider\"><div class=\"review-item\"><div class=\"review-rating-line\"><img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\"><span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Today</span></div><div class=\"reviewer-info\"><div class=\"profile-placeholder\"><span class=\"m-auto\">R</span></div><span class=\"customer-name\">Rachel L.</span><div class=\"verified-badge\"><img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\"><span>Verified</span></div></div><h3 class=\"review-title\">Peace of Mind on Every Drive</h3><p class=\"review-text\">I just feel better knowing I have Auto Air with me while I drive. I used it before a long trip to check my tires and topped one off in minutes. Now I always keep it in the glovebox, just in case.</p><div class=\"team-reply\"><p class=\"reply-intro\"><b><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b></b> replied:</p><p class=\"reply-text\">That's what we love to hear, Rachel! Staying road-ready and stress-free is what Auto Air's all about. Thanks for trusting us to keep you rolling smoothly. 🚗💨</p></div></div><hr class=\"review-divider\"><div class=\"review-item\"><div class=\"review-rating-line\"><img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\"><span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Today</span></div><div class=\"reviewer-info\"><div class=\"profile-placeholder\"><span class=\"m-auto\">K</span></div><span class=\"customer-name\">Kelly D.</span><div class=\"verified-badge\"><img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\"><span>Verified</span></div></div><h3 class=\"review-title\">Safer Having It</h3><p class=\"review-text\">I drive home late from work sometimes, and knowing I have Auto Air with me is reassuring. It’s easy to use, fits perfectly in my center console, and the built-in light is so handy.</p><div class=\"team-reply\"><p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p><p class=\"reply-text\">We’re so glad Auto Air helps you feel safe and prepared, Kelly. A little peace of mind goes a long way. Thanks for sharing and drive safe out there! 🌙✨</p></div></div><hr class=\"review-divider\"><div class=\"review-item\"><div class=\"review-rating-line\"><img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\"><span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Today</span></div><div class=\"reviewer-info\"><div class=\"profile-placeholder\"><span class=\"m-auto\">J</span></div><span class=\"customer-name\">Jason M.</span><div class=\"verified-badge\"><img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\"><span>Verified</span></div></div><h3 class=\"review-title\">Weekend Trip Saver</h3><p class=\"review-text\">Used Auto Air on a camping trip when one of our tires looked low. It worked perfectly and even recharged my phone while we packed up. Definitely keeping this in the car full time now.</p><div class=\"team-reply\"><p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p><p class=\"reply-text\">Love it, Jason! Adventure tested and road approved. That power bank feature comes in handy when you’re off the grid. Thanks for taking Auto Air along for the ride! ⛺🔋</p></div></div><hr class=\"review-divider\"><div class=\"review-item\"><div class=\"review-rating-line\"><img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\"><span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Today</span></div><div class=\"reviewer-info\"><div class=\"profile-placeholder\"><span class=\"m-auto\">S</span></div><span class=\"customer-name\">Steve R.</span><div class=\"verified-badge\"><img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\"><span>Verified</span></div></div><h3 class=\"review-title\">One of the Handiest Gadgets I Own</h3><p class=\"review-text\">This little pump is so convenient. I’ve used it on my car, bike tires, and even my inflatable kayak. The charge lasts forever and it’s super easy to use.</p><div class=\"team-reply\"><p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p><p class=\"reply-text\">Thanks, Steve! We love hearing how versatile Auto Air is for your adventures. From the driveway to the lake, we’ve got your back. 🌊🚗</p></div></div><hr class=\"review-divider\">\n\n<div class=\"review-item\"><div class=\"review-rating-line\"><img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\"><span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Today</span></div>\n<div class=\"reviewer-info\"><div class=\"profile-placeholder\"><span class=\"m-auto\">M</span></div><span class=\"customer-name\">Melissa G.</span><div class=\"verified-badge\">\n<img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\"><span>Verified</span></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"review-title\">Perfect Gift for My Son</h3><p class=\"review-text\">Bought this for my son who just got his first car. He says it’s easy to use and already helped him refill a low tire. As a mom, that peace of mind is priceless.</p><div class=\"team-reply\"><p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n<p class=\"reply-text\">That’s wonderful to hear, Laura! Auto Air was made for exactly that peace of mind. We’re thrilled it’s helping your son stay safe on the road. 🚙❤️</p></div></div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Yesterday</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">L</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Laura M.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Couldn’t Believe How Fast It Worked</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">I was on my way to pick up my kids from school when my low tire light came on. I pulled into a parking lot, grabbed my AutoAir, and within 4 minutes the light went off. I didn’t even get my hands dirty! It’s small, simple, and worth every penny.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Laura, We’re so glad AutoAir saved the day (and the school pickup)! Thank you for sharing your story, that’s exactly what we love hearing. A quick, clean fix and back to life in minutes. Appreciate you trusting us to keep your drives stress-free!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Yesterday</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">D</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">David T.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Reliable little machine</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">I’ve worked as a contractor for 22 years and I’m picky about my tools. This one impressed me. Used it on the work truck twice already. It’s quick, quiet, and the PSI reading is spot on. Feels like something made to last.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi David, We really appreciate your kind words! Hearing this from someone with your experience means a lot. We built AutoAir to handle real-world use, and we’re thrilled it’s earned a spot in your truck. Stay safe on the job!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Yesterday</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">A</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Alyssa N.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Saved my weekend trip!</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">We were heading to the mountains for a family getaway when my husband noticed a tire losing air. He laughed at me for packing AutoAir until it got us back on the road in 10 minutes. Now he won’t stop showing it off. 😂</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Alyssa, That made us smile, sounds like AutoAir converted another skeptic! We’re so glad it kept your family trip on track. Thanks for packing it (and proving your husband wrong in the best way).</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted Yesterday</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">M</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Michael M.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Solid Gear for My Work Truck</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">I keep AutoAir under the seat of my F-150. Between job sites and long commutes, I use it way more than expected. I’ve topped off tires, filled the kids’ basketballs, even aired up my wheelbarrow. It’s powerful for the size, charges quickly, and that PSI auto-stop is a genius feature.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Michael, we appreciate you taking the time to write such a detailed review! It’s awesome to hear how well AutoAir fits into your day-to-day life. Thank you for trusting it to handle the heavy-duty stuff.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted 3 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">J</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">James B.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Powerful Little Compressor</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">Honestly, I thought this would be more of a “just in case” gadget, but I’ve already used it four times this month. It’s quiet, accurate, and the battery lasts forever. I bought a second one for my wife’s car.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Thanks James. We love hearing that! Sounds like AutoAir’s getting plenty of use. Great call grabbing a second one, sharing is caring, but we get it! Thanks again for your support.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted 3 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">K</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Kimberly V.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Didn’t expect to love it this much</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">Honestly I bought autoair thinking “maybe it’ll help someday.” I’ve used it a few times already in 2 months, once on my car, twice for my son’s bike, and one time to blow up a beach ball when our pump broke. It’s easy and quiet.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Kimberly, We love this! Sounds like AutoAir’s become a go-to tool around your house. Thank you for sharing all the ways you’re using it</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted 3 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">J</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Jamie W.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Saved me from calling roadside assistance</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">Had a slow leak coming home from work. I pulled over, hooked this thing up, and was rolling again in 7 minutes. No waiting for a tow or paying $80 for someone to do what I just did myself.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Jamie, That’s exactly what we built it for, quick self-reliance when you need it most. Thanks for sharing and glad you got home safe!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted 4 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">R</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Ricky M.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Works better than I expected</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">Small but mighty. I’ve got an old truck and the tires lose air constantly. This thing tops them off quick and I haven’t had to hit a gas station compressor in months.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Ricky, love to hear that! We’re glad AutoAir’s keeping your truck ready to roll, and saving you those gas station trips.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted 4 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">T</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Tony G.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Perfect for long drives</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">I do DoorDash full time and can’t afford downtime. I keep AutoAir in the passenger seat pocket. Already used it twice mid-shift. Fast, accurate, and the digital gauge is on point.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Tony, we know those long shifts can be rough, glad AutoAir’s got your back on the road. Thanks for sharing how it helps keep your wheels turning!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"review-divider\">\n<div class=\"review-item\">\n    <div class=\"review-rating-line\">\n        <img alt=\"5 stars\" class=\"star-rating\" src=\"./images/intera/rating-star.svg\">\n        <span class=\"post-date d-md-block\">Posted 5 days ago</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n        <div class=\"profile-placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"m-auto\">C</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"customer-name\">Caleb H.</span>\n        <div class=\"verified-badge\">\n            <img alt=\"Verified\" class=\"check-icon\" src=\"./images/intera/check-highlight.svg\">\n            <span>Verified</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"review-title\">Didn’t even read the manual</h3>\n    <p class=\"review-text\">Opened the box, charged it, and figured it out in 30 seconds. Straightforward and works exactly like it should. Used it three times already.</p>\n    <div class=\"team-reply\">\n        <p class=\"reply-intro\"><b>&gt;&gt; Auto Air Team</b> replied:</p>\n        <p class=\"reply-text\">Hi Caleb, we’ll take that as the ultimate compliment! Thanks for confirming it’s as intuitive as we hoped. Glad it’s working great for you.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n <div id=\"show-more-container\" class=\"text-center mt-8\">\n            <button id=\"show-more-btn\" class=\"show-more-btn\">\n                Show More Reviews\n            </button>\n        </div>\n</div>","insertHtml":{},"styles":"{}"}, undefined, 1004661388); 
